+ * (720 and 1104 Mbps) would each need Easel re-rated per stream. Skipped:
+ * res2 (zzHDR, needs a merge nobody implements), res5 (240 fps, 1776 Mbps --
+ * the one mode the pinned rate cannot carry) and res7 (a copy of res1).
